<title>DENMARK: FLS up 3.0 pct on 96 profits, 97 outlook.</title>
<headline>FLS up 3.0 pct on 96 profits, 97 outlook.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish engineering group FLS Industries' share rose by 3.0 percent on Tuesday after it reported 1996 profits up 68 percent to 951 million crowns from 1995's 566 million and forecast still better results for 1997.</p>
<p>At 1400 GMT the share traded at 845 crowns, up 25 from Monday's close.</p>
<p>&quot;The bottom-line result exceeds forecasts and expectations (for 1997) look good. We are maintaining our buy recommendation on FLS shares,&quot; an analyst told Reuters earlier.</p>
<p>-- Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
